16
00:00:44,160 --> 00:00:45,200
Even my hair looks the same.

17
00:00:45,680 --> 00:00:46,120
Oh my gosh.

18
00:00:46,120 --> 00:00:47,320
We're watching at home today.

19
00:00:47,320 --> 00:00:48,080
Yes.

20
00:00:48,280 --> 00:00:48,640
Yeah.

21
00:00:49,200 --> 00:00:50,400
Can't wait.

22
00:00:50,400 --> 00:00:51,320
I seriously can't wait.

23
00:00:51,320 --> 00:00:52,520
I really didn't expect

24
00:00:52,520 --> 00:00:54,360
that final

25
00:00:54,360 --> 00:00:55,680
confession scene.

26
00:00:55,680 --> 00:00:57,240
It felt just like a wedding.

27
00:00:57,240 --> 00:00:58,120
Yeah, totally like a wedding.

28
00:00:58,120 --> 00:01:00,040
I think it was even

29
00:01:00,040 --> 00:01:00,480
more

30
00:01:00,480 --> 00:01:01,160
extravagant.

31
00:01:01,160 --> 00:01:02,800
It was incredible.

32
00:01:02,800 --> 00:01:03,480
I wanna hold this.

33
00:01:04,120 --> 00:01:04,920
You take that one.

34
00:01:05,600 --> 00:01:06,720
