Whatever you want.

36
00:01:07,640 --> 00:01:07,920
You.

37
00:01:07,920 --> 00:01:08,360
Me?

38
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:12,920
Cover up with this blanket.

39
00:01:12,920 --> 00:01:14,080
Okay, thanks.

40
00:01:16,280 --> 00:01:17,160
How does it feel?

41
00:01:17,360 --> 00:01:19,040
It's our first time watching alone.

42
00:01:19,200 --> 00:01:19,840
Right?

43
00:01:20,360 --> 00:01:21,680
And it's our last watch-along.

44
00:01:21,760 --> 00:01:23,160
Feels pretty special.

45
00:01:23,160 --> 00:01:24,200
Yeah, it's episode ten.

46
00:01:24,200 --> 00:01:25,440
Know what we're watching today?

47
00:01:25,440 --> 00:01:26,720
Our confessions.

48
00:01:30,160 --> 00:01:31,000
Nervous?

49
00:01:31,400 --> 00:01:32,920
Not really. I'm excited.

50
00:01:32,920 --> 00:01:33,800
Me too.

51
00:01:34,480 --> 00:01:37,080
It's our first watch-along together.

52
00:01:38,000 --> 00:01:38,640
After all this time,

53
00:01:38,640 --> 00:01:40,720
I finally get to watch with you.

54
00:01:41,720 --> 00:01:42,640
I'm so happy.

55
00:01:42,640 --> 00:01:43,560
Me too.

56
00:01:45,520 --> 00:01:46,680
This is quite

57
00:01:47,050 --> 00:01:47,720
a fruit spread.

58
00:01:47,720 --> 00:01:49,280
All your favorites, right?

59
00:01:49,280 --> 00:01:51,160
Just like back
when we did the watch-alongs.

60
00:01:51,160 --> 00:01:52,080
It's the same.

61
00:01:52,080 --> 00:01:53,000
We had fruit then too.

62
00:01:53,000 --> 00:01:55,400
Our last watch-along
was in Thailand.

63
00:01:56,040 --> 00:01:57,080
Come on. Let's celebrate.

64
00:01:57,080 --> 00:01:58,080
It's our last watch-along.

65
00:01:58,400 --> 00:01:59,640
The very last one.

66
00:02:02,840 --> 00:02:04,400
Babe, are you excited

67
00:02:04,400 --> 00:02:05,520
