69
00:02:07,360 --> 00:02:07,960
I am.

70
00:02:07,960 --> 00:02:09,160
I'm super excited too.

71
00:02:09,760 --> 00:02:12,800
You looked absolutely gorgeous that day.

72
00:02:13,000 --> 00:02:13,840
During the confession.

73
00:02:15,240 --> 00:02:16,560
I honestly barely remember

74
00:02:16,560 --> 00:02:18,760
