75
00:02:19,640 --> 00:02:22,160
We were both so emotional.

76
00:02:22,480 --> 00:02:24,040
Let's hear your side, then.

77
00:02:24,320 --> 00:02:26,080
Remember the two letters I gave you?

78
00:02:26,800 --> 00:02:29,120
Between the first and second letters,

79
00:02:29,280 --> 00:02:30,120
I was holding flowers

80
00:02:30,120 --> 00:02:31,040
and waiting

81
00:02:32,040 --> 00:02:34,200
on the lawn where I confessed.

82
00:02:34,480 --> 00:02:35,280
While I was waiting,

83
00:02:35,280 --> 00:02:36,880
I was so...

84
00:02:38,240 --> 00:02:39,040
nervous.

85
00:02:40,040 --> 00:02:41,120
Before I even showed up?

86
00:02:41,120 --> 00:02:42,120
Yeah, you weren't even there yet.

87
00:02:43,000 --> 00:02:44,240
I was already so emotional

88
00:02:44,520 --> 00:02:46,440
I could barely hold back my tears.

89
00:02:46,840 --> 00:02:47,480
But I held them back.

90
00:02:47,480 --> 00:02:48,000
Kept it together.

91
00:02:48,320 --> 00:02:48,840
I told myself, no.

92
00:02:48,840 --> 00:02:50,280
She's not even here yet.

93
00:02:50,280 --> 00:02:51,840
I can't be crying my eyes out.

94
00:02:51,840 --> 00:02:52,640
I couldn't let that happen.

95
00:02:54,120 --> 00:02:55,400
Let's stick to our usual routine.

96
00:02:55,490 --> 00:02:56,320
Hi, everyone.

97
00:02:56,320 --> 00:02:58,520
I'm Sun Bohan

98
00:02:58,520 --> 00:02:59,300
(Sun Bohan)
from Heart Signal 9.

99
00:03:00,560 --> 00:03:01,680
It's just the two of us.

100
00:03:02,800 --> 00:03:04,000
Hi, everyone. I'm...

101
00:03:05,120 --> 00:03:05,960
Stop looking at me!

102
00:03:06,880 --> 00:03:07,600
Hi, everyone.

103
00:03:07,600 --> 00:03:09,240
(Wu Xingying)
I'm Wu Xingying

104
00:03:09,240 --> 00:03:10,360
from Heart Signal 9.

105
00:03:12,840 --> 00:03:13,880
Let's get started.

106
00:03:20,480 --> 00:03:21,440
This was

107
00:03:21,440 --> 00:03:22,840
(Flowers)
our last park date, right?

108
00:03:23,560 --> 00:03:25,280
(Wu Xingying)
Who's that?

109
00:03:25,280 --> 00:03:26,350
(Xing looks gorgeous today)
That hairstyle.

110
00:03:29,200 --> 00:03:30,440
Two big dragon whiskers.

111
00:03:34,520 --> 00:03:36,000
You really called them
big dragon whiskers?

112
00:03:36,480 --> 00:03:37,920
They're little dragon whiskers, okay?

113
00:03:38,210 --> 00:03:38,670
Let's go.

114
00:03:38,720 --> 00:03:39,740
So gorgeous.

115
00:03:39,740 --> 00:03:40,030
Slow down.

116
00:03:40,030 --> 00:03:41,090
It's okay. Let's walk together.

117
00:03:43,200 --> 00:03:44,070
So gorgeous.

118
00:03:44,070 --> 00:03:44,760
You look really pretty.

119
00:03:45,090 --> 00:03:46,050
The weather's nice. Not much wind.

120
00:03:46,080 --> 00:03:47,040
A date in the park

121
00:03:47,040 --> 00:03:49,360
(We've had our share of bad weather)
is pretty relaxing, right?

122
00:03:49,360 --> 00:03:51,000
(We've been through it all)
And the weather was great that day.

123
00:03:51,840 --> 00:03:52,800
I was really looking forward to it.

124
00:03:52,810 --> 00:03:54,150
(Clear skies from here on out)
Especially our date.

125
00:03:54,150 --> 00:03:54,450
Yeah.

126
00:03:54,450 --> 00:03:55,240
Like things finally turned around.

127
00:03:55,240 --> 00:03:57,000
I think it made up for one

128
00:03:57,000 --> 00:03:57,800
(Yeah, it'll always be like this)
regret.

129
00:03:57,800 --> 00:03:58,320
Yeah.

130
00:03:58,320 --> 00:03:58,980
(Better days are here)
You love park walks.

131
00:03:58,980 --> 00:03:59,860
(Yeah, smooth sailing from now on)
You love park walks.

132
00:04:01,320 --> 00:04:02,660
You can't walk too fast right now.

133
00:04:02,660 --> 00:04:03,730
(Supports her)
Take it slow.

134
00:04:03,730 --> 00:04:04,570
Sit here. Okay.

135
00:04:04,790 --> 00:04:05,090
Okay.

136
00:04:06,860 --> 00:04:08,400
I'll grab a mat. One sec.

137
00:04:08,850 --> 00:04:11,110
(A mat prepared in advance)
Go ahead and sit.

138
00:04:11,110 --> 00:04:11,530
Okay.

139
00:04:12,230 --> 00:04:13,910
This way, you won't
get cold sitting down.

140
00:04:13,910 --> 00:04:14,390
Okay.

141
00:04:17,160 --> 00:04:18,520
So beautiful.

142
00:04:18,520 --> 00:04:19,520
Just laugh if you want.

143
00:04:19,520 --> 00:04:21,240
Holding it in must be hard, huh?

144
00:04:21,240 --> 00:04:22,600
I'm not holding back around you anymore.

145
00:04:23,040 --> 00:04:23,620
What's this?

146
00:04:23,620 --> 00:04:24,820
Tiger-skin eggs, right?

147
00:04:25,310 --> 00:04:25,880
Yeah, I do.

148
00:04:25,880 --> 00:04:26,580
I do!

149
00:04:27,480 --> 00:04:28,750
And some sweet potato fries.

150
00:04:28,750 --> 00:04:29,820
(Tiger-skin eggs
and sweet potato fries prepared by Xing)

151
00:04:29,820 --> 00:04:31,520
Because last time we ate together,

152
00:04:31,520 --> 00:04:32,410
