158
00:04:38,060 --> 00:04:38,740
and they'd taste sweet.

159
00:04:39,200 --> 00:04:40,040
Eat leaves?

160
00:04:40,240 --> 00:04:40,920
Really?

161
00:04:41,280 --> 00:04:43,000
If I'd made you leaves back then,

162
00:04:43,000 --> 00:04:43,640
would they taste sweet?

163
00:04:43,880 --> 00:04:45,520
Sure. I'd eat anything you made.

164
00:04:45,980 --> 00:04:46,780
(Done eating)

165
00:04:46,980 --> 00:04:47,880
Let's go then.

166
00:04:48,330 --> 00:04:48,800
Okay.

167
00:04:50,060 --> 00:04:51,980
(Packs everything away carefully)

168
00:04:52,220 --> 00:04:53,420
Are you getting hot, Xing?

169
00:04:53,630 --> 00:04:54,250
I'm okay.

170
00:04:54,630 --> 00:04:55,370
Are you hot?

171
00:04:55,620 --> 00:04:56,340
I'm not.

172
00:04:56,500 --> 00:04:57,700
(Back soaked with sweat)

173
00:04:57,720 --> 00:05:00,360
I'm not hot.

174
00:05:00,840 --> 00:05:02,280
I knew you were hot back then.

175
00:05:04,720 --> 00:05:05,520
You just wouldn't admit it.

176
00:05:06,600 --> 00:05:07,680
It was pretty hot that day.

177
00:05:07,680 --> 00:05:09,080
- And I was wearing a...
- Really hot.

178
00:05:09,080 --> 00:05:09,520
Shirt.

179
00:05:09,920 --> 00:05:11,320
A thick shirt.

180
00:05:11,680 --> 00:05:12,710
Why don't we sit here?

181
00:05:16,310 --> 00:05:17,430
(Takes out a mat)
Here, sit on this.

182
00:05:17,440 --> 00:05:17,840
Okay.

183
00:05:18,290 --> 00:05:19,060
He doesn't want her getting cold.

184
00:05:19,060 --> 00:05:20,100
(Lays it out carefully)

185
00:05:25,880 --> 00:05:27,000
You're blushing.

186
00:05:27,000 --> 00:05:27,800
I was a little shy.

187
00:05:28,120 --> 00:05:28,920
Suddenly, we're on a date.

188
00:05:28,920 --> 00:05:30,240
Sitting face-to-face

189
00:05:30,240 --> 00:05:31,520
feels a little awkward.

190
00:05:32,710 --> 00:05:33,560
Didn't they say

191
00:05:33,560 --> 00:05:34,970
we should exchange little gifts?

192
00:05:35,470 --> 00:05:36,370
I looked for a long time

193
00:05:36,370 --> 00:05:36,750
and picked

194
00:05:36,750 --> 00:05:37,650
a CCD.

195
00:05:37,650 --> 00:05:39,180
(Prepared a CCD camera)

196
00:05:40,060 --> 00:05:41,440
Yeah. I just hope

197
00:05:41,440 --> 00:05:43,440
we can take lots of pictures together

198
00:05:43,440 --> 00:05:44,410
and capture our memories.

199
00:05:44,480 --> 00:05:46,080
(Happy memories)
We've taken so many pictures.

200
00:05:46,320 --> 00:05:48,100
(Yeah)
We bring it on every trip.

201
00:05:48,100 --> 00:05:49,100
(Capturing our happy moments)
We always do.

202
00:05:49,100 --> 00:05:49,800
Every single time.

203
00:05:49,960 --> 00:05:50,720
Let me take your picture.

204
00:05:50,720 --> 00:05:51,920
I took lots of pictures

205
00:05:51,920 --> 00:05:52,520
of us today too.

206
00:05:52,520 --> 00:05:53,320
Yeah.

207
00:05:53,720 --> 00:05:55,320
It's as essential as our phones now.

208
00:05:55,320 --> 00:05:55,960
Exactly.

209
00:05:56,130 --> 00:05:56,440
Ready?

210
00:05:57,350 --> 00:06:00,100
Three, two, one.

211
00:06:00,200 --> 00:06:01,120
So pretty.

212
00:06:02,770 --> 00:06:03,530
Gorgeous.

213
00:06:04,650 --> 00:06:05,680
When everyone went out,

214
00:06:05,680 --> 00:06:06,200
