215
00:06:06,200 --> 00:06:07,130
Did you feel like you missed out?

216
00:06:08,210 --> 00:06:09,690
What I regretted

217
00:06:09,690 --> 00:06:11,120
was not getting to go out with you.

218
00:06:11,510 --> 00:06:12,390
Honestly, I have always

219
00:06:12,390 --> 00:06:13,730
felt a little guilty.

220
00:06:14,020 --> 00:06:15,180
(Feels guilty)

221
00:06:17,180 --> 00:06:18,060
When you first

222
00:06:18,060 --> 00:06:19,050
called me,

223
00:06:19,050 --> 00:06:19,760
you said

224
00:06:20,290 --> 00:06:21,040
you were upset

225
00:06:21,040 --> 00:06:22,870
because I didn't get
to spend time with everyone

226
00:06:22,870 --> 00:06:23,770
in the Signal House.

227
00:06:24,140 --> 00:06:25,640
I felt bad for you too

228
00:06:25,640 --> 00:06:27,010
for not getting to stay
in the Couples House

229
00:06:27,010 --> 00:06:27,660
with everyone.

230
00:06:27,680 --> 00:06:28,260
Babe.

231
00:06:28,260 --> 00:06:29,140
(Blames herself)

232
00:06:34,680 --> 00:06:36,400
One minute you're laughing,
the next you're crying.

233
00:06:38,080 --> 00:06:39,240
Don't look at me.

234
00:06:39,920 --> 00:06:40,760
What's wrong?

235
00:06:40,760 --> 00:06:41,920
Why are you crying?

236
00:06:42,320 --> 00:06:43,720
Because I didn't go?

237
00:06:44,680 --> 00:06:45,840
What if I had gone?

238
00:06:46,320 --> 00:06:47,400
Wouldn't you be even sadder?

239
00:06:47,600 --> 00:06:48,400
No.

240
00:06:49,040 --> 00:06:49,880
You're unbelievable.

241
00:06:50,840 --> 00:06:51,440
Seriously, no.

242
00:06:51,440 --> 00:06:52,560
You'd be bawling if I went.

243
00:06:52,760 --> 00:06:55,040
You'd be sobbing under the covers.

244
00:06:55,040 --> 00:06:55,720
If I'd gone,

245
00:06:55,720 --> 00:06:56,960
