246
00:06:56,960 --> 00:06:58,600
You'd just think, he's not worth it.

247
00:06:59,480 --> 00:07:00,920
I'd never think that.

248
00:07:01,160 --> 00:07:03,040
So have we made up for that regret?

249
00:07:03,240 --> 00:07:03,880
Definitely.

250
00:07:03,880 --> 00:07:05,240
We're already in Thailand together.

251
00:07:05,840 --> 00:07:08,080
I can't even argue with that answer.

252
00:07:08,080 --> 00:07:08,880
So true.

253
00:07:09,300 --> 00:07:12,250
You're like this universal

254
00:07:13,280 --> 00:07:14,250
