255
00:07:14,660 --> 00:07:16,700
(Smiles)
He's good with words.

256
00:07:16,740 --> 00:07:19,030
I'm really lucky I met you.

257
00:07:19,370 --> 00:07:20,820
Me too.

258
00:07:20,910 --> 00:07:21,250
Yeah.

259
00:07:21,520 --> 00:07:23,480
By then, we'd actually gotten

260
00:07:23,480 --> 00:07:25,880
much closer than

261
00:07:25,880 --> 00:07:26,680
on our first park date.

262
00:07:26,680 --> 00:07:27,400
This time,

263
00:07:27,400 --> 00:07:27,960
we'd been through

264
00:07:27,960 --> 00:07:29,280
so much together already.

265
00:07:29,280 --> 00:07:30,840
So I had mixed feelings.

266
00:07:31,800 --> 00:07:34,400
But if we were closer,
why mixed feelings?

267
00:07:35,200 --> 00:07:37,040
Well, it definitely wasn't like

268
00:07:37,040 --> 00:07:39,040
our first park date,

269
00:07:39,040 --> 00:07:41,240
when everything felt so uncertain.

270
00:07:41,840 --> 00:07:43,200
That's true.

271
00:07:43,200 --> 00:07:45,080
On our first city date,

272
00:07:45,640 --> 00:07:47,760
you were like a mystery box.

273
00:07:47,760 --> 00:07:49,600
A box that hadn't been opened.

274
00:07:50,600 --> 00:07:53,200
I had no idea what was inside.

275
00:07:53,640 --> 00:07:54,840
So when we first went

276
00:07:54,840 --> 00:07:56,280
on our city date and park date,

277
00:07:56,280 --> 00:07:57,480
it felt like

278
00:07:57,790 --> 00:07:59,960
a wonderful mystery.

279
00:08:01,080 --> 00:08:02,800
But from then on,

280
00:08:02,800 --> 00:08:03,880
as we got to know each other,

281
00:08:03,880 --> 00:08:05,360
I realized you weren't just a surprise.

282
00:08:05,360 --> 00:08:06,480
You were an unexpected gift.

283
00:08:06,480 --> 00:08:07,160
An incredible one.

284
00:08:09,000 --> 00:08:10,440
And this time,

285
00:08:10,440 --> 00:08:11,760
on our second park date,

286
00:08:11,760 --> 00:08:12,640
I felt like

287
00:08:13,000 --> 00:08:14,400
even without an official confession,

288
00:08:14,400 --> 00:08:16,200
we were already

289
00:08:16,200 --> 00:08:17,600
really close.

290
00:08:18,960 --> 00:08:20,480
Boss, did I sum that up right?

291
00:08:21,680 --> 00:08:22,440
Pretty much.

292
00:08:22,640 --> 00:08:24,200
Anything you'd like to add?

293
00:08:24,360 --> 00:08:26,840
Didn't we keep going to parks afterward?

294
00:08:26,840 --> 00:08:29,280
I think we visit parks
more than anywhere else.

295
00:08:29,840 --> 00:08:31,480
We've been to so many parks in Beijing.

296
00:08:34,830 --> 00:08:35,530
What's happening here?

297
00:08:35,880 --> 00:08:36,960
(What's he reaching for?)
What was I doing?

298
00:08:37,800 --> 00:08:39,400
Getting your phone to add me on WeChat?

299
00:08:41,070 --> 00:08:41,470
Well...

300
00:08:41,470 --> 00:08:43,470
So, Xing...

301
00:08:46,000 --> 00:08:47,820
I was...

302
00:08:48,070 --> 00:08:48,630
What is it?

303
00:08:52,860 --> 00:08:53,900
(Can't get the words out)

304
00:08:56,080 --> 00:08:57,170
Tomorrow, we'll

305
00:08:57,170 --> 00:08:58,710
be back to normal life.

306
00:09:00,060 --> 00:09:01,010
Yeah, and...

307
00:09:03,290 --> 00:09:05,670
(Can I add you on WeChat?)
Why was I so awkward?

308
00:09:06,330 --> 00:09:06,800
Okay.

309
00:09:07,540 --> 00:09:09,040
I'll scan yours, Xing.

310
00:09:09,040 --> 00:09:10,290
He sounds like a real estate agent!

311
00:09:10,400 --> 00:09:11,160
An agent.

312
00:09:11,160 --> 00:09:14,120
What was our first WeChat message again?

313
00:09:14,120 --> 00:09:14,760
You said...

314
00:09:15,840 --> 00:09:17,440
Let me look it up.

315
00:09:17,440 --> 00:09:19,680
Let's show everyone

316
00:09:19,680 --> 00:09:21,320
our very first WeChat messages.

317
00:09:25,200 --> 00:09:27,440
You said, "Back in your room, Xing?"

318
00:09:27,760 --> 00:09:29,320
You typed Xing.

319
00:09:29,320 --> 00:09:30,600
I typed Xing too.

320
00:09:30,880 --> 00:09:32,440
I replied, "What a coincidence."

321
00:09:32,440 --> 00:09:33,600
"I just picked up my phone."

322
00:09:33,600 --> 00:09:34,840
I asked, "Are you home yet?"

323
00:09:34,840 --> 00:09:36,040
You said, "Not yet."

324
00:09:36,400 --> 00:09:36,840
"Almost there."

325
00:09:36,840 --> 00:09:38,120
"It's pretty far from here."

326
00:09:38,120 --> 00:09:40,040
I said, "So getting here"

327
00:09:40,040 --> 00:09:41,320
"must take a while too."

328
00:09:41,320 --> 00:09:42,640
You said, "Usually just 30 minutes."

329
00:09:42,640 --> 00:09:43,440
"It's not that far."

330
00:09:43,600 --> 00:09:44,880
I said, "Text me when you get home."

331
00:09:45,880 --> 00:09:46,600
That was it.

332
00:09:50,720 --> 00:09:52,060
While we've still got

333
00:09:52,640 --> 00:09:53,040
good lighting,

334
00:09:53,040 --> 00:09:54,220
how about

335
00:09:54,220 --> 00:09:55,290
taking a few pictures?

336
00:09:55,460 --> 00:09:55,680
Sure.

337
00:09:55,680 --> 00:09:56,110
Sound good?

338
00:09:56,520 --> 00:09:57,540
Let's head over there.

339
00:09:57,540 --> 00:09:57,940
Okay.

340
00:09:59,890 --> 00:10:00,510
Three, two, one.

341
00:10:00,520 --> 00:10:03,080
(Beautiful)
Just like in Inner Mongolia.

342
00:10:03,080 --> 00:10:04,760
Yeah, it's actually pretty rare.

343
00:10:04,960 --> 00:10:06,400
(You're so beautiful, Xing)
We saw Venus beside the moon there too.

344
00:10:06,400 --> 00:10:06,940
The moon.

345
00:10:07,060 --> 00:10:07,900
(Can't take his eyes off her)

346
00:10:08,120 --> 00:10:08,450
Xing,

347
00:10:08,450 --> 00:10:10,040
you look gorgeous in this picture.

348
00:10:11,130 --> 00:10:11,750
He can't even see

349
00:10:11,750 --> 00:10:12,910
himself on the screen.

350
00:10:12,910 --> 00:10:13,900
He only sees Xing.

351
00:10:13,900 --> 00:10:14,210
Yeah.

352
00:10:19,040 --> 00:10:20,800
How do you feel
after watching our park date,

353
00:10:20,800 --> 00:10:21,320
babe?

354
00:10:21,320 --> 00:10:22,240
I can really feel

355
00:10:22,240 --> 00:10:23,240
what we were thinking

356
00:10:23,240 --> 00:10:24,720
and feeling back then.

357
00:10:25,880 --> 00:10:26,880
Like what?

358
00:10:27,120 --> 00:10:28,160
Tell me more.

359
00:10:29,040 --> 00:10:29,760
So many moments.

360
00:10:29,760 --> 00:10:30,840
Like when you took out your phone

361
00:10:30,840 --> 00:10:31,880
to ask for my WeChat.

362
00:10:31,880 --> 00:10:33,160
I remember that moment so clearly.

363
00:10:33,720 --> 00:10:34,160
I really...

364
00:10:34,160 --> 00:10:35,920
I'd totally forgotten about

365
00:10:35,920 --> 00:10:37,040
asking for your WeChat.

366
00:10:37,320 --> 00:10:39,320
And then suddenly,

367
00:10:39,760 --> 00:10:40,800
they showed

368
00:10:40,800 --> 00:10:42,720
that clip of me asking for your WeChat.

369
00:10:43,760 --> 00:10:44,880
I was so awkward.

370
00:10:45,680 --> 00:10:46,320
You weren't.

371
00:10:46,680 --> 00:10:47,320
Not at all.

372
00:10:47,320 --> 00:10:49,560
I was trying to play it cool,

373
00:10:49,560 --> 00:10:52,280
but I ended up
looking like a total dork.

374
00:10:52,680 --> 00:10:53,480
You're not a dork.

375
00:10:53,880 --> 00:10:55,280
If you'd just casually said,

376
00:10:55,280 --> 00:10:56,480
"Let's add each other on WeChat,"

377
00:10:56,480 --> 00:10:57,720
I might've thought

378
00:10:57,720 --> 00:11:00,040
you didn't really care either way,

379
00:11:00,640 --> 00:11:01,320
right?

380
00:11:01,640 --> 00:11:02,840
So it all worked out perfectly.

381
00:11:03,600 --> 00:11:04,760
You're so good with words.

382
00:11:06,760 --> 00:11:07,160
Finally,

383
00:11:07,160 --> 00:11:08,360
we can talk quietly now.

384
00:11:08,360 --> 00:11:08,960
It's just so quiet.

385
00:11:08,960 --> 00:11:10,440
I feel awkward talking loudly.

386
00:11:10,440 --> 00:11:11,680
As long as I can hear you

387
00:11:11,680 --> 00:11:12,520
and you can hear me,

388
00:11:12,520 --> 00:11:13,760
we're good.

389
00:11:13,760 --> 00:11:14,360
Yeah.

390
00:11:14,720 --> 00:11:15,320
True.

391
00:11:15,320 --> 00:11:16,960
It's weird with just the two of us.

392
00:11:17,440 --> 00:11:18,080
Eat and drink

393
00:11:18,080 --> 00:11:18,880
whatever you want.

394
00:11:19,280 --> 00:11:20,360
Make ourselves at home.

395
00:11:21,520 --> 00:11:22,640
Hi, everyone.

396
00:11:22,640 --> 00:11:24,240
We're Everlasting YiHeng.

397
00:11:24,240 --> 00:11:25,280
I'm Cui Kaiyi.

398
00:11:25,280 --> 00:11:26,240
(Cui Kaiyi)
I'm Cao Yiheng.

399
00:11:26,240 --> 00:11:27,520
(Cao Yiheng)
We're back for another watch-along.

400
00:11:27,520 --> 00:11:28,040
We're back.

401
00:11:28,040 --> 00:11:28,520
Today we're watching

402
00:11:29,200 --> 00:11:30,000
the confession.

403
00:11:30,000 --> 00:11:30,640
The final confession.

404
00:11:31,000 --> 00:11:31,680
Here we go.

405
00:11:32,360 --> 00:11:32,880
Looking sharp.

406
00:11:33,720 --> 00:11:35,280
You look just like that today.

407
00:11:35,280 --> 00:11:36,840
Yeah, I wore the same outfit on purpose.

408
00:11:36,840 --> 00:11:37,520
Exactly the same.

409
00:11:37,520 --> 00:11:38,320
To relive the moment.

410
00:11:38,320 --> 00:11:39,540
(Cui Kaiyi)
Relive the moment?

411
00:11:39,540 --> 00:11:40,520
So beautiful!

412
00:11:46,960 --> 00:11:48,050
Cui Kaiyi with her hair up

413
00:11:48,050 --> 00:11:49,120
looks like a princess.

414
00:11:49,320 --> 00:11:50,480
It's up today too.

415
00:11:51,680 --> 00:11:52,420
Isn't that

416
00:11:52,420 --> 00:11:54,290
the dress Cao Yiheng

417
00:11:54,290 --> 00:11:55,580
fell for at first sight?

418
00:11:58,390 --> 00:11:59,120
Haitao, tell me.

419
00:11:59,120 --> 00:12:00,160
If your partner

420
00:12:00,160 --> 00:12:02,400
wore the same outfit
from your first meeting

421
00:12:02,400 --> 00:12:04,080
when you met again...

422
00:12:04,120 --> 00:12:05,000
(Game over)
How did you feel

423
00:12:05,000 --> 00:12:05,760
when you first saw me?

424
00:12:05,760 --> 00:12:07,320
You didn't know I'd wear yellow, right?

425
00:12:07,800 --> 00:12:08,800
No, I didn't.

426
00:12:09,760 --> 00:12:11,840
But I really loved

427
00:12:11,840 --> 00:12:12,480
the dress you wore

428
00:12:12,480 --> 00:12:13,880
when I first looked up at you.

429
00:12:13,880 --> 00:12:15,000
That yellow dress.

430
00:12:15,000 --> 00:12:15,640
At the dinner party.

431
00:12:15,640 --> 00:12:16,720
Our first dinner party.

432
00:12:16,720 --> 00:12:17,440
And this time,

433
00:12:17,440 --> 00:12:18,720
I felt like

434
00:12:18,720 --> 00:12:20,600
I could finally stand beside you.

435
00:12:21,640 --> 00:12:22,280
Like

436
00:12:22,280 --> 00:12:23,920
instead of looking up,
we were eye to eye.

437
00:12:32,220 --> 00:12:33,300
So full of energy.

438
00:12:40,120 --> 00:12:41,200
So that's what the angle looked like.

439
00:12:42,560 --> 00:12:43,000
What?

440
00:12:43,000 --> 00:12:44,160
Don't you look handsome from there?

441
00:12:44,520 --> 00:12:45,120
I do.

442
00:12:47,320 --> 00:12:49,200
(Together again)
Compared to last time,

443
00:12:49,200 --> 00:12:50,280
(Together again)
I felt much more relaxed.

444
00:12:50,280 --> 00:12:51,320
Much more relaxed.

445
00:12:51,320 --> 00:12:52,000
How come?

446
00:12:53,680 --> 00:12:55,480
It's different when you're
officially a couple.

447
00:12:58,430 --> 00:13:00,300
You're wearing
your yellow dress from day one.

448
00:13:02,980 --> 00:13:04,240
You noticed.

449
00:13:05,700 --> 00:13:06,630
Are you nervous today?

450
00:13:07,140 --> 00:13:08,010
Of course I am.

451
00:13:08,010 --> 00:13:08,690
Nervous again?

452
00:13:08,930 --> 00:13:10,050
It's your second confession.

453
00:13:10,050 --> 00:13:11,310
Still nervous?

454
00:13:12,890 --> 00:13:13,600
Yep.

455
00:13:16,900 --> 00:13:19,200
(You prepared a confession too?)
See my hair blowing?

456
00:13:19,200 --> 00:13:20,350
Of course I prepared one.

457
00:13:20,800 --> 00:13:22,080
(Mine might be tricky to take out)
There was a little breeze.

458
00:13:22,080 --> 00:13:23,600
Yeah, right before the downpour.

459
00:13:23,600 --> 00:13:24,580
- I'll go first.
- Okay, you first.

460
00:13:24,580 --> 00:13:25,170
You went first last time.

461
00:13:25,180 --> 00:13:26,160
(I'm afraid if I hear yours first)
Luckily, I managed

462
00:13:26,160 --> 00:13:27,320
(I won't be able to read mine)
to finish reading my letter.

463
00:13:27,680 --> 00:13:28,550
(Okay, you go first)
Yeah.

464
00:13:29,060 --> 00:13:29,680
When did you write all this?

465
00:13:29,680 --> 00:13:30,680
Your ribbon

466
00:13:30,680 --> 00:13:32,440
matched my dress perfectly.

467
00:13:32,440 --> 00:13:33,240
What a coincidence.

468
00:13:33,240 --> 00:13:34,920
Like I ripped it right off your dress.

469
00:13:34,920 --> 00:13:35,480
Yeah.

470
00:13:35,480 --> 00:13:37,480
Did you secretly steal something off me?

471
00:13:37,480 --> 00:13:38,040
Just borrowed a piece.

472
00:13:39,870 --> 00:13:43,590
This is for my Sunflower Yiheng.

473
00:13:43,900 --> 00:13:45,020
He can't stop smiling.

474
00:13:46,510 --> 00:13:47,690
Ever since I found out

475
00:13:47,690 --> 00:13:48,700
what you told me that day,

476
00:13:48,700 --> 00:13:50,850
that at the dinner party,

477
00:13:50,850 --> 00:13:53,080
you'd been watching me for a long time,

478
00:13:55,100 --> 00:13:56,160
I started thinking

479
00:13:56,160 --> 00:13:58,340
I wanted to wear

480
00:13:58,340 --> 00:13:59,680
that pale yellow dress again.

481
00:14:00,230 --> 00:14:02,780
That day, I was sitting in a crowd.

482
00:14:02,780 --> 00:14:04,280
But this time,

483
00:14:04,480 --> 00:14:06,690
I wanted only you to see me like this.

484
00:14:07,940 --> 00:14:09,420
(Just for you)

485
00:14:09,440 --> 00:14:10,040
Why are you

486
00:14:10,040 --> 00:14:11,240
- How wonderful.
- crying again?

487
00:14:11,680 --> 00:14:12,360
I don't know.

488
00:14:12,360 --> 00:14:12,760
To the guy...

489
00:14:12,760 --> 00:14:13,600
You don't know?

490
00:14:13,600 --> 00:14:14,810
The guy in the corner,

491
00:14:14,810 --> 00:14:15,510
I want to say,

492
00:14:15,510 --> 00:14:16,290
I like you.

493
00:14:25,120 --> 00:14:25,910
What?

494
00:14:26,370 --> 00:14:27,670
I like you too.

495
00:14:28,090 --> 00:14:29,410
I've only read one paragraph!

496
00:14:30,060 --> 00:14:31,020
Just one paragraph.

497
00:14:32,520 --> 00:14:34,720
- One paragraph and Dai Xu's crying.
- Sorry, everyone!

498
00:14:34,990 --> 00:14:35,780
Just one paragraph.

499
00:14:35,780 --> 00:14:36,620
(Already overwhelmed)

500
00:14:37,090 --> 00:14:38,320
- Keep reading. It's okay.
- So adorable.

501
00:14:38,320 --> 00:14:39,200
Oh, Dai Xu.

502
00:14:40,440 --> 00:14:42,620
In our first week as a couple,

503
00:14:43,010 --> 00:14:45,350
I heard so many things

504
00:14:45,350 --> 00:14:47,190
I'd never heard before.

505
00:14:47,920 --> 00:14:49,400
How can you be so adorable?

506
00:14:52,630 --> 00:14:54,150
When they announced

507
00:14:54,810 --> 00:14:57,210
our relationship needs test results

508
00:14:57,210 --> 00:14:59,140
at the dinner table,
you proudly told me,

509
00:14:59,600 --> 00:15:01,470
"See? I told you you're the sun!"

510
00:15:03,690 --> 00:15:05,860
I think someday I'll need

511
00:15:06,230 --> 00:15:08,220
a stamp card for Cao Yiheng.

512
00:15:08,360 --> 00:15:10,040
With sides A, B, C, D, and E.

513
00:15:11,500 --> 00:15:13,750
Just the day before,
I'd confidently said

514
00:15:14,350 --> 00:15:15,810
I didn't get separation anxiety.

515
00:15:18,470 --> 00:15:19,930
But the moment you hugged me,

516
00:15:19,930 --> 00:15:21,200
I suddenly realized

517
00:15:21,200 --> 00:15:22,880
I didn't want to leave your side.

518
00:15:24,380 --> 00:15:26,300
After we leave the house,

519
00:15:26,930 --> 00:15:28,590
I hope tickets from Fengtai to Wuqing

520
00:15:28,590 --> 00:15:30,570
will pile up on my desk.

521
00:15:33,730 --> 00:15:35,990
Each one will mean we've kept

522
00:15:35,990 --> 00:15:38,260
our promise to meet
at least three times

523
00:15:38,260 --> 00:15:38,830
a week.

524
00:15:42,160 --> 00:15:43,120
I can't.

525
00:15:43,600 --> 00:15:44,680
This is too much.

526
00:15:47,840 --> 00:15:48,880
It's

527
00:15:48,880 --> 00:15:50,520
a happy confession this time.

528
00:15:52,760 --> 00:15:55,160
I'm crying at the exact
same moment as myself onscreen.

529
00:16:03,000 --> 00:16:04,760
You came prepared this time?

530
00:16:05,040 --> 00:16:06,160
- Careful, my makeup.
- You planned ahead.

531
00:16:06,160 --> 00:16:08,010
Last time, you gave me
such a rough cloth.

532
00:16:08,010 --> 00:16:08,800
I'll just dab gently.

533
00:16:08,880 --> 00:16:10,480
I've improved this time.

534
00:16:10,720 --> 00:16:11,880
Learned my lesson.

535
00:16:11,880 --> 00:16:12,720
Works pretty well.

536
00:16:12,720 --> 00:16:13,600
Like magic.

537
00:16:13,600 --> 00:16:14,360
Magic.

538
00:16:14,360 --> 00:16:14,960
Tissues.

539
00:16:16,650 --> 00:16:19,030
You asked me to save a spot

540
00:16:19,030 --> 00:16:21,300
on my desk for our video calls.

541
00:16:21,920 --> 00:16:22,790
Although I've

542
00:16:23,790 --> 00:16:25,410
just finished my senior year of college

543
00:16:25,410 --> 00:16:27,420
and don't even have a new desk yet,

544
00:16:29,370 --> 00:16:30,110
in my heart,

545
00:16:30,110 --> 00:16:30,930
that spot

546
00:16:30,930 --> 00:16:32,320
has always been yours.

547
00:16:32,860 --> 00:16:34,580
(In my heart, that spot
has always been yours)

548
00:16:34,600 --> 00:16:36,240
That's true.

549
00:16:36,240 --> 00:16:37,080
I feel like you've

550
00:16:37,080 --> 00:16:38,560
actually followed through

551
00:16:38,840 --> 00:16:40,640
on everything in your letter.

552
00:16:41,120 --> 00:16:42,640
I really have my own spot now

553
00:16:42,640 --> 00:16:43,680
on your desk.

554
00:16:44,680 --> 00:16:46,160
And meeting three times a week?

555
00:16:46,680 --> 00:16:47,800
More than three.

556
00:16:47,800 --> 00:16:49,800
Was there a day
we didn't meet this week?

557
00:16:51,120 --> 00:16:51,800
Feels like

558
00:16:51,800 --> 00:16:53,200
we've met every day this week.

559
00:16:55,490 --> 00:16:57,620
Someone once asked me

560
00:16:58,240 --> 00:16:59,280
a question.

561
00:16:59,280 --> 00:17:01,170
What would I say to my future boyfriend?

562
00:17:05,770 --> 00:17:06,610
My answer was,

563
00:17:07,250 --> 00:17:08,050
"Thank you."

564
00:17:08,450 --> 00:17:10,400
"Thank you for bringing life"

565
00:17:10,400 --> 00:17:11,840
"to a barren part of my heart."

566
00:17:11,840 --> 00:17:13,050
Thank you, Cao Yiheng.

567
00:17:13,050 --> 00:17:15,170
You filled my Yellow Space

568
00:17:15,170 --> 00:17:16,260
with sunshine.

569
00:17:16,820 --> 00:17:18,450
You made me believe

570
00:17:18,450 --> 00:17:19,570
there really is someone...

571
00:17:19,680 --> 00:17:21,080
- who'll always be by my side.
- That was the general idea.

572
00:17:21,080 --> 00:17:23,600
- The wording might've been different.
- Never thought I'd be someone's sunshine.

573
00:17:24,600 --> 00:17:26,000
But you're my sunshine.

574
00:17:26,320 --> 00:17:28,000
Even sunshine needs nourishment.

