Well, that's a wrap for today's...

1434
00:46:13,880 --> 00:46:16,440
YangShizi watch-along!

1435
00:46:19,000 --> 00:46:20,080
How did you feel on the night

1436
00:46:20,080 --> 00:46:21,280
before the confession?

1437
00:46:21,280 --> 00:46:22,160
A bit nervous

1438
00:46:22,160 --> 00:46:22,840
and anxious.

1439
00:46:23,080 --> 00:46:24,000
Why?

1440
00:46:24,000 --> 00:46:25,400
Because I was thinking

1441
00:46:25,400 --> 00:46:26,800
about what to say during the confession,

1442
00:46:26,800 --> 00:46:27,880
but I wasn't sure if I could actually

1443
00:46:27,880 --> 00:46:29,360
get everything out.

1444
00:46:29,840 --> 00:46:31,000
What if my mind

1445
00:46:31,000 --> 00:46:32,520
went completely blank?

1446
00:46:32,520 --> 00:46:33,600
Didn't that happen?

1447
00:46:34,680 --> 00:46:36,000
No, you did amazing.

1448
00:46:36,680 --> 00:46:37,480
Every word hit the spot.

1449
00:46:37,480 --> 00:46:38,840
Did you even listen to what I said?

1450
00:46:38,840 --> 00:46:39,760
Do you even remember?

1451
00:46:40,160 --> 00:46:41,560
It hit right in the heart, seriously.

1452
00:46:41,560 --> 00:46:43,200
Alright, name three things

1453
00:46:43,200 --> 00:46:44,640
I said during my confession.

1454
00:46:45,960 --> 00:46:46,920
"It takes a kind person to notice"

1455
00:46:46,920 --> 00:46:47,960
"that kindness in someone else."

1456
00:46:47,960 --> 00:46:48,400
One.

1457
00:46:48,400 --> 00:46:50,760
"I feel like you're quite thoughtful."

1458
00:46:51,160 --> 00:46:52,480
"Quite sensitive."

1459
00:46:54,320 --> 00:46:55,120
Alright, two.

1460
00:46:55,120 --> 00:46:56,040
And "I feel"

1461
00:46:56,520 --> 00:46:58,160
"safe around you."

1462
00:46:59,440 --> 00:46:59,880
See?

1463
00:47:00,040 --> 00:47:00,600
Hehe.

1464
00:47:02,080 --> 00:47:02,760
Nailed it.

1465
00:47:03,880 --> 00:47:04,160
Wait.

1466
00:47:07,600 --> 00:47:09,040
When you watch it later,

1467
00:47:09,040 --> 00:47:10,280
will you be moved to tears?

1468
00:47:10,720 --> 00:47:11,680
Probably not.

1469
00:47:11,680 --> 00:47:13,400
Really? We shall see.

1470
00:47:13,400 --> 00:47:13,960
Alright.

1471
00:47:13,960 --> 00:47:14,800
Which one do you want?

1472
00:47:16,920 --> 00:47:17,720
Just one.

1473
00:47:18,320 --> 00:47:19,600
Have the mango.

1474
00:47:21,520 --> 00:47:23,920
I'll eat the kitty.

1475
00:47:23,920 --> 00:47:24,640
It's a kitten.

1476
00:47:24,640 --> 00:47:25,240
Did you notice?

1477
00:47:26,240 --> 00:47:27,440
As sweet as you.

1478
00:47:27,920 --> 00:47:29,000
You haven't even tasted it.

1479
00:47:36,640 --> 00:47:39,040
How should we introduce ourselves?

1480
00:47:39,040 --> 00:47:40,440
Which name do you like better?

1481
00:47:40,440 --> 00:47:42,560
I saw a lot of ship names

1482
00:47:42,560 --> 00:47:43,360
from fans.

1483
00:47:43,360 --> 00:47:44,880
Some people call us "Incredible SiYi."

1484
00:47:44,880 --> 00:47:45,920
"Incredible SiYi."

1485
00:47:45,920 --> 00:47:47,280
"Picturesque SiYi."

1486
00:47:47,280 --> 00:47:48,400
- Because...
- Let's go with "Incredible SiYi."

1487
00:47:48,400 --> 00:47:49,080
I didn't expect this.

1488
00:47:49,080 --> 00:47:50,600
So it really is pretty "incredible."

1489
00:47:50,600 --> 00:47:51,680
Then let's say hi.

1490
00:47:52,200 --> 00:47:53,240
Hi, everyone.

1491
00:47:53,240 --> 00:47:55,160
We are "Incredible SiYi."

1492
00:47:55,160 --> 00:47:56,160
(Wu Siying)
I'm Wu Siying.

1493
00:47:56,160 --> 00:47:57,000
(Cui Yihang)
I'm Cui Yihang.

1494
00:47:57,880 --> 00:47:58,960
So shall we start?

1495
00:47:58,960 --> 00:47:59,920
Let's do it.

1496
00:48:08,220 --> 00:48:08,920
So handsome.

1497
00:48:12,030 --> 00:48:12,840
So pretty.

1498
00:48:13,040 --> 00:48:14,040
You were so gorgeous.

1499
00:48:14,800 --> 00:48:15,800
Oh my.

1500
00:48:24,560 --> 00:48:26,080
I look a bit puffy.

1501
00:48:27,520 --> 00:48:29,000
Not at all. I look round too.

1502
00:48:29,000 --> 00:48:30,200
- Hi.
- You looked good that day.

1503
00:48:30,200 --> 00:48:31,400
You looked handsome, too.

1504
00:48:31,400 --> 00:48:32,000
Really?

1505
00:48:32,000 --> 00:48:34,240
I was grinning like crazy. My gosh.

1506
00:48:40,300 --> 00:48:41,240
Over here?

1507
00:48:41,920 --> 00:48:43,890
I've never seen you
wear light colors before.

1508
00:48:44,230 --> 00:48:45,600
I wanted to show you
a different side of me.

1509
00:48:48,240 --> 00:48:49,840
You actually said that?

1510
00:48:51,520 --> 00:48:53,160
I was pretty bold back then.

1511
00:48:54,480 --> 00:48:55,440
Not bad.

1512
00:48:55,440 --> 00:48:58,640
What other colors
do you want to wear for me now?

1513
00:48:58,640 --> 00:48:59,840
I'll wear them all.

1514
00:49:01,320 --> 00:49:02,640
Then there are
still plenty I haven't seen.

1515
00:49:02,640 --> 00:49:02,960
Yeah.

1516
00:49:02,960 --> 00:49:04,240
I haven't seen red yet.

1517
00:49:04,240 --> 00:49:05,200
I'll wear them one by one.

1518
00:49:07,070 --> 00:49:08,910
I used to be

1519
00:49:08,910 --> 00:49:10,570
someone who kept things to myself

1520
00:49:10,570 --> 00:49:12,520
and wasn't good
at expressing my feelings.

1521
00:49:12,860 --> 00:49:13,860
But from now on,

1522
00:49:14,100 --> 00:49:15,780
I want to tell you more.

1523
00:49:15,780 --> 00:49:18,260
So I might ramble a little.

1524
00:49:18,530 --> 00:49:20,800
That's okay. Take your time.

1525
00:49:23,080 --> 00:49:24,250
Dear Si...

1526
00:49:26,640 --> 00:49:27,700
Dear Si...

1527
00:49:27,700 --> 00:49:28,700
(Shy)

1528
00:49:29,990 --> 00:49:32,130
My first impression
of you was at the dinner.

1529
00:49:32,450 --> 00:49:34,140
You asked me to describe

1530
00:49:34,140 --> 00:49:35,220
what animal you reminded me of.

1531
00:49:36,110 --> 00:49:37,360
I looked at you...

1532
00:49:37,360 --> 00:49:38,240
What's wrong?

1533
00:49:38,240 --> 00:49:39,880
Nothing.

1534
00:49:39,880 --> 00:49:40,920
Here's a tissue.

1535
00:49:42,200 --> 00:49:43,120
No need.

1536
00:49:43,120 --> 00:49:43,840
Use it.

1537
00:49:43,840 --> 00:49:44,840
Grab another one.

1538
00:49:46,160 --> 00:49:46,960
Yeah.

1539
00:49:47,160 --> 00:49:49,420
Kind of stayed in my mind.

1540
00:49:52,540 --> 00:49:52,820
Whoa.

1541
00:49:52,840 --> 00:49:53,880
Such a huge face.

1542
00:49:53,880 --> 00:49:55,400
How cute.

1543
00:49:55,670 --> 00:49:56,760
On our first day at the house,

1544
00:49:56,760 --> 00:49:58,950
you were totally focused
on doing the dishes.

1545
00:49:59,190 --> 00:50:00,650
That really caught my attention.

1546
00:50:01,740 --> 00:50:03,180
You seemed so genuine and cute.

1547
00:50:03,420 --> 00:50:06,100
Being with you

1548
00:50:06,100 --> 00:50:07,040
just feels easy.

1549
00:50:07,690 --> 00:50:08,780
Calm, but never dull.

1550
00:50:10,390 --> 00:50:11,280
Warm, but never overwhelming.

1551
00:50:12,770 --> 00:50:14,680
If this were our everyday life,

1552
00:50:15,990 --> 00:50:16,820
we'd probably be really happy.

1553
00:50:16,840 --> 00:50:17,600
Chubby guy.

1554
00:50:17,600 --> 00:50:18,660
(If this were our everyday life,
we'd probably be really happy)

1555
00:50:20,120 --> 00:50:21,760
What a chubby, tanned guy I was.

1556
00:50:24,040 --> 00:50:24,760
You're not chubby.

1557
00:50:27,440 --> 00:50:28,850
Even at night,

1558
00:50:29,720 --> 00:50:30,710
I'd think about you.

1559
00:50:30,960 --> 00:50:31,970
I'd think about you.

1560
00:50:35,280 --> 00:50:36,740
He's so shy.

1561
00:50:36,920 --> 00:50:38,520
You were so shy, huh?

1562
00:50:38,520 --> 00:50:39,840
I was super shy.

1563
00:50:41,550 --> 00:50:43,840
I'd go back to our very first day

1564
00:50:43,840 --> 00:50:46,360
and choose the Yellow Space

1565
00:50:47,090 --> 00:50:47,870
so I'd meet you first.

1566
00:50:52,080 --> 00:50:52,880
What's wrong?

1567
00:50:54,440 --> 00:50:56,520
Just remembering how it felt?

1568
00:50:57,120 --> 00:50:59,400
Do you still want to go back
to the Yellow Space?

1569
00:51:01,720 --> 00:51:04,200
Because back then I was anxious,

1570
00:51:04,200 --> 00:51:05,760
feeling like time
in the house flew by so fast.

1571
00:51:06,910 --> 00:51:07,700
I just felt like

1572
00:51:08,680 --> 00:51:09,640
I didn't want to waste a single day.

1573
00:51:09,640 --> 00:51:11,120
Day one was
the only day I didn't see you.

1574
00:51:11,830 --> 00:51:13,880
And looking back now, honestly,

1575
00:51:13,880 --> 00:51:15,200
everything has its pros and cons.

1576
00:51:15,200 --> 00:51:17,120
Because I was
going to meet you sooner or later.

1577
00:51:17,120 --> 00:51:18,360
So it's fine.

1578
00:51:18,360 --> 00:51:20,320
As long as it all
turned out well in the end.

1579
00:51:21,720 --> 00:51:22,760
Need a tissue?

1580
00:51:22,760 --> 00:51:23,800
No.

1581
00:51:25,540 --> 00:51:29,460
(Don't go anywhere. The next episode
is even more romantic.)
